  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.10 — Publish net3000.servicecoordinator again (SocialPosts / ApiConnectionsDB are in content.dll metadata); pin the version content.dll is compiled against so NuGet no longer resolves SC 1.0.0 without SocialPosts (#7778). Facebook, Google, LinkedIn, Twilio stay PrivateAssets (#2306). 1.0.9 — Private video hosting on Cloudflare Stream (net3000-ca/applications#4275): CmVideoApiRow gains isPrivateHosted / streamStatus / durationSeconds, new CmStreamPlaybackRow, and lib.getCmStreamVideoForPlaybackAsync loads a video's Stream UID only for a viewer who passes the same visibility filters the listings apply. The UID and the raw thumbnail URL are never in the public shape. lib.getCmStreamVideosByIdsAsync (#4276) loads the same fields for an app that gates by its own rule (SC course enrollment). Additive API only. 1.0.8 — Preserve an existing submission dateCreated field when reloading edited form data, including encrypted attachment deletion (#5280). 1.0.7 — lib.FriendlyLinkOwnerTitleAsync names the CMS page or category that owns a friendly link (#5133). Additive. 1.0.6 — PrivateAssets on Facebook, Google, LinkedIn, ServiceCoordinator, Twilio optional integrations so they do not appear on the published NuGet graph (#2306 / #2238). common remains the published foundation peer. Social/SMS posting code still compiles against those ProjectReferences in-repo (interim until extract). 1.0.5: Bootstrap 5 dual-compatibility in emitted menu markup - menu emitter adds data-bs-toggle alongside data-toggle, and the default navbar-nav class lists emit both mr-auto and me-auto (each Bootstrap version ignores the other) so menus work under BS4 and BS5 consumers (epic net3000-ca/applications#1764, issue #1795). Fixed package dependencies to properly include net3000.common and service dependencies.",
